{"seq":7,"slug":"lc0019-remove-nth-node-from-end","title":"LeetCode 19 删除链表的倒数第 N 个结点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0019-remove-nth-node-from-end","wordCount":869,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-19-删除链表的倒数第-n-个结点\">LeetCode 19 删除链表的倒数第 N 个结点</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个链表，删除链表的倒数第 <code>n</code> 个结点，并且返回链表的头结点。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1,2,3,4,5]</code>, <code>n = 2</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[1,2,3,5]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1]</code>, <code>n = 1</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1,2]</code>, <code>n = 1</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[1]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表中结点的数目为 <code>sz</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= sz &lt;= 30</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= sz</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>进阶：</strong> 你能尝试使用一趟扫描实现吗？</p>\n<p>本题的关键挑战是「倒数第 N 个」这个定位方式。在单链表中无法从尾部反向遍历，因此需要巧妙的方法来定位目标节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-两次遍历\">方法一：两次遍历</h3><p>最直接的方法是先遍历一次获得链表长度 L，然后再遍历一次找到第 <code>L - n</code> 个节点（即倒数第 n 个节点的前驱），执行删除操作。这需要两次遍历。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法二-快慢指针-一次遍历\">方法二：快慢指针（一次遍历）</h3><p>快慢指针的核心思想是让两个指针之间保持固定间距 n，当快指针到达末尾时，慢指针恰好指向倒数第 n 个节点的前驱。</p>\n<p>具体步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>创建哑节点 <code>dummy</code>，其 <code>next</code> 指向 <code>head</code></li>\n<li>快指针 <code>fast</code> 先从 <code>dummy</code> 出发，向前走 <code>n + 1</code> 步</li>\n<li>然后快慢指针同时移动，直到快指针到达 <code>null</code></li>\n<li>此时慢指针 <code>slow</code> 指向待删除节点的前驱</li>\n<li>执行 <code>slow.next = slow.next.next</code> 完成删除</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>为什么是 n+1 步？</strong> 因为我们需要 <code>slow</code> 停在待删除节点的<strong>前驱</strong>位置，这样才能执行删除。如果快指针先走 n 步，慢指针最终会停在待删除节点本身，无法修改其前驱的指针。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么需要哑节点？</strong> 当需要删除的是头节点时（即 n 等于链表长度），如果没有哑节点，就无法统一处理逻辑。哑节点让 <code>slow</code> 可以停在 <code>dummy</code> 上，通过 <code>dummy.next = head.next</code> 完成头节点的删除。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>遍历次数</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>两次遍历</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快慢指针</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class ListNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  next: ListNode | null;&#10;  constructor(val?: number, next?: ListNode | null) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.next = next ?? null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function removeNthFromEnd(head: ListNode | null, n: number): ListNode | null {&#10;  const dummy = new ListNode(0, head);&#10;  let fast: ListNode | null = dummy;&#10;  let slow: ListNode | null = dummy;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt;= n; i++) {&#10;    fast = fast!.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  while (fast !== null) {&#10;    fast = fast.next;&#10;    slow = slow!.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  slow!.next = slow!.next!.next;&#10;  return dummy.next;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> removeNthFromEnd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dummy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, head);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  slow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"执行过程示例\">执行过程示例</h3><p>以 <code>head = [1,2,3,4,5]</code>，<code>n = 2</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>fast 位置</th>\n<th>slow 位置</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始</td>\n<td>dummy</td>\n<td>dummy</td>\n<td>两指针都在哑节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前进1步</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>dummy</td>\n<td>fast 前进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前进2步</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>dummy</td>\n<td>fast 前进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前进3步</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>dummy</td>\n<td>fast 共走 n+1=3 步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>同时前进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>同时前进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步3</td>\n<td>null</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>fast 到达末尾</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>此时 <code>slow</code> 在节点 3，它的 <code>next</code> 是节点 4（倒数第 2 个），执行 <code>slow.next = slow.next.next</code>（节点 5），结果为 <code>[1,2,3,5]</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"边界情况\">边界情况</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>删除头节点</strong>：<code>n = sz</code>，快指针先走 n+1 步后恰好到达 <code>null</code>，慢指针留在 <code>dummy</code>，执行 <code>dummy.next = dummy.next.next</code></li>\n<li><strong>单节点链表删除</strong>：<code>head = [1], n = 1</code>，删除后返回 <code>null</code></li>\n<li><strong>删除尾节点</strong>：<code>n = 1</code>，慢指针到达倒数第二个节点，将其 <code>next</code> 置为 <code>null</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(L)</td>\n<td>L 为链表长度，仅需一次遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>仅使用常数个指针变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 快指针总共移动 L + 1 步（先走 n+1 步，再走 L-n 步），慢指针移动 L-n 步，总操作次数为 O(L)。相比两次遍历法的 2L 步，常数因子更小。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 除了 <code>dummy</code>、<code>fast</code>、<code>slow</code> 三个指针外，不需要额外空间。<code>dummy</code> 节点是 O(1) 的额外空间。</p>\n<p>快慢指针是链表题中最重要的技巧之一。「保持固定间距」的思想还可以应用于求链表中点（LC #876）、判断链表是否有环（LC #141）等问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 19 删除链表的倒数第 N 个结点","id":"leetcode-19-删除链表的倒数第-n-个结点"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：两次遍历","id":"方法一-两次遍历"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：快慢指针（一次遍历）","id":"方法二-快慢指针-一次遍历"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":3,"text":"边界情况","id":"边界情况"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 2 两数相加","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0002-add-two-numbers"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 24 两两交换链表中的节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0024-swap-nodes-in-pairs"}}